        <title-group>
          <article-title lang="original"><![CDATA[반성 없는 근대적 주체의 초상-조연현의 1950년대 비평 연구]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="foreign"><![CDATA[The Portrait of the Modern Subject That does not Reflect on Itself - A Study on Jo, Yeon-hyun's Criticisms in the 1950s -]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="english"><![CDATA[The Portrait of the Modern Subject That does not Reflect on Itself - A Study on Jo, Yeon-hyun's Criticisms in the 1950s -]]></article-title>
        </title-group>
        <author-group>
          <author author-division="1">
            <name><![CDATA[박근예]]></name>
